WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.490
The asteroid belt.

00:02.190 --> 00:12.049
Between the paths of Mars and Jupiter there are more than a million rocks, left over from the making of the planets about four and a half billion years ago.

00:12.499 --> 00:17.581
It is mostly empty space: all of them together weigh less than our Moon.

00:18.031 --> 00:21.841
The map draws the few it carries, each where it is today.
